"name": "Houlihan Lokey, Inc.",
"description": "Houlihan Lokey, Inc. engages in the provision of investment banking services. It operates through the following segments: Corporate Finance, Financial Restructuring, and Financial and Valuation Advisory. The Corporate Finance segment offers general financial advisory services in addition to advice on mergers and acquisitions and capital markets offering. The Financial Restructuring segment provides advice to debtors, creditors, and parties-in-interest in connection with recapitalization or deleveraging transactions. The Financial Valuation and Advisory Services segment is involved in the valuation of various assets including companies, illiquid debt and equity securities, and intellectual property. The company was founded in 1972 and is headquartered in Los Angeles, CA.",
